  "coverage": [
    "Both seats, six on-play token creators: source changes controller and is Recalled, remains at its original battlefield, relocates to the other battlefield, or leaves play. Check token controller, physical location, readiness, identity, resources, pending completion and clone equality.",
    "Both seats: movement-triggered unit and equipment-granted token effects resolve after a bearer control change, at a different battlefield or opposing base, preserving the original ability actor.",
    "An impossible fixed play preserves Energy, Power, XP and score and restores its next-unit ready grant; the following legal play consumes that same grant and enters ready.",
    "Public pending destinations expose both physical bases to both viewers. Real Antagonistic Apparatus plays in both seats expose matching pending/decision destinations, reject a different battlefield without state or revision mutation, and finalize the ready token at base.",
    "Native physical-base wording covers both token controllers and both bases. Existing core click flows pass at normal and small sizes, including optional token costs, disabled field choices, and finalization."
  ],
